    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When the primary player’s content specifies the schedule of interstitial events intrinsically, this property value typically changes whenever primary player’s [`currentItem`](avplayer/currentitem.md) changes.",
      "ko": "해당 값은 장치에 Desk View 카메라가 존재하는 경우 이를 제공하며, 이 카메라는 장치의 울트라 와이드 카메라에서 프레이밍을 파생합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2e6ee8f708fecc7bbd77a15c24312c76b4ec837b564fe7b46f57e9e8dd8d021f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "For HLS content that specifies interstitials using of `DATERANGE` tags, the value of this property may also change whenever the set of `DATERANGE` tags in the current item’s media playlist changes.",
      "ko": "시스템에 여러 개의 Continuity Camera 디바이스가 있는 경우, 이 속성을 사용해 특정 인스턴스를 해당 Desk View 디바이스와 연결해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "493eb11964aecbc44351bb4c320bafd98e4f943e4a57ab904df3c69e0cf07719",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "When you specify the schedule of interstitial events using an [`AVPlayerInterstitialEventController`](avplayerinterstitialeventcontroller.md), this property value changes only when you update the interstitial event controller’s schedule.",
      "ko": "이 속성의 값을 변경하기 전에 [`lockForConfiguration()`](avcapturedevice/lockforconfiguration().md) 을 호출해 장치 구성 속성에 대한 배타적 접근 권한을 먼저 획득해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1388bcfced5275979214cfcf45dbb7ad97d1999db855297185e76443b8b79acd",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: The elements in the [`events`](avplayerinterstitialeventmonitor/events.md) array are immutable.",
      "ko": "**Note**: The elements in the [`events`](avplayerinterstitialeventmonitor/events.md) array are immutable.",
      "sourceHash": "24e2f53e087868563e3b1fdd94633a42fa66104db95ed8d1f6392747ee0e9e52",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Attempting to modify them generates an exception.",
      "ko": "Attempting to modify them generates an exception.",
      "sourceHash": "b097ab492b29cc93656efcb1e28eacf852139be2dbdbdfae7539321220bccaf8",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0003",
      "source": "To alter an event, make a copy and modify the new instance.",
      "ko": "To alter an event, make a copy and modify the new instance.",
      "sourceHash": "596e9e9172c0c64595b684f0bdf2ab69f2f9ce24372447f4c9169943e37ca618",
      "status": "failed"
